#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:52
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This chapter describes assistive technologies for users who are blind, "
"focusing primarily on screen readers and tools designed to work in "
"conjunction with them.  The chapter deliberately contains no images and aims "
"to minimize the use of elements other than plain text."
msgstr "本章介绍为盲人用户提供的辅助技术，主要介绍屏幕阅读器及其配套工具。本章特意不包含任何图像，并尽量减少纯文本以外元素的使用。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:58
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Screen Reader"
msgstr "屏幕阅读器"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Currently, screen readers function only within the extref:{handbook}x11[X "
"Window System] and are not supported in the crossref:virtual-"
"terminal[virtual-terminal,Virtual Terminal].  FreeBSD does not currently "
"support Braille displays, so they rely exclusively on speech synthesizers."
msgstr "目前，屏幕阅读器只能在 extref:{handbook}x11[X Window System] 中运行，crossref:virtual-terminal[virtual-terminal,虚拟终端] 尚不支持屏幕阅读器。FreeBSD 目前不支持盲文显示器，因此屏幕阅读器只能使用语音合成器。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:64
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Orca"
msgstr "Orca"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orca is a widely used and well-known open source screen reader.  It offers a "
"comprehensive set of features and is available on FreeBSD through the "
"package:accessibility/orca[] package."
msgstr "Orca 是一款广泛使用且广为人知的开源屏幕阅读器，功能全面，可通过 package:accessibility/orca[] 软件包在 FreeBSD 上使用。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:70
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:356
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:73
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install it, execute:"
msgstr "执行以下命令进行安装："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:77
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install orca\n"
msgstr "# pkg install orca\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:80
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:84
#, fuzzy
msgid "Orca can be launched in several ways.  From a terminal, type:"
msgstr "启动 Orca 有多种方式。在终端中输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:88
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% orca\n"
msgstr "% orca\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some desktop environments (extref:{handbook}desktop/#kde-environment[KDE "
"Plasma], extref:{handbook}desktop/#xfce-environment[XFCE], extref:{handbook}"
"desktop/#gnome-environment[GNOME])  provide a keyboard shortcut to launch "
"Orca: `Super` + `Alt` + `s`."
msgstr "某些桌面环境（extref:{handbook}desktop/#kde-environment[KDE Plasma]、extref:{handbook}desktop/#xfce-environment[XFCE]、extref:{handbook}desktop/#gnome-environment[GNOME]）提供了启动 Orca 的键盘快捷键：`Super` + `Alt` + `s`。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:100
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Super key is usually labeled as Windows icon, Command icon, or \"Super"
"\".  Refer to https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_key_(keyboard_button) for "
"more information."
msgstr "Super 键通常标有 Windows 图标、Command 图标或“Super”。更多信息请参阅 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_key_(keyboard_button)[]。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:103
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:366
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:108
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orca provides a manual page: man:orca[1].  However, most of the "
"documentation is available online.  The main reference is the starting point "
"in the https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/orca/help/[Orca Users Guide], "
"which includes:"
msgstr "Orca 提供了手册页：man:orca[1]。不过，大部分文档都可以在线查阅。主要参考资料是 link:https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/orca/help/[Orca 用户指南]的入门部分，其中包括："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:110
#, fuzzy
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:111
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reading Documents and Web Pages"
msgstr "阅读文档和网页"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:112
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reviewing and Interacting with Screen Contents"
msgstr "查看和操作屏幕内容"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:115
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The screen reader includes many keyboard commands for navigation and "
"interaction.  Refer to the https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/orca/help/"
"commands.html[Orca's Commands] page for a full list."
msgstr "屏幕阅读器包含许多用于导航和交互的键盘命令。完整列表请参阅 link:https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/orca/help/commands.html[Orca 命令]页面。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:117
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:120
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orca can be configured through a graphical settings interface. To open it, "
"run:"
msgstr "Orca 可通过图形化设置界面进行配置。运行以下命令即可打开："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:124
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% orca -s\n"
msgstr "% orca -s\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:127
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Configuration options are documented on the https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome."
"org/orca/help/preferences.html[Orca's Preferences Dialogs] page."
msgstr "配置选项的说明请参阅 link:https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/orca/help/preferences.html[Orca 首选项对话框]页面。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:129
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "yasr"
msgstr "yasr"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:134
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:accessibility/yasr[] utility is a lightweight screen reader that "
"operates exclusively in a terminal environment.  Yasr requires a speech "
"synthesizer to work.  Its default configuration file is set up to use "
"package:accessibility/eflite[]."
msgstr "package:accessibility/yasr[] 是一款轻量级屏幕阅读器，仅在终端环境中运行。Yasr 需要语音合成器才能工作。其默认配置文件已设置为使用 package:accessibility/eflite[]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:136
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install both yasr and eflite, run:"
msgstr "运行以下命令安装 yasr 和 eflite："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:140
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install yasr eflite\n"
msgstr "# pkg install yasr eflite\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:143
#, fuzzy
msgid "To start the screen reader, execute:"
msgstr "执行以下命令启动屏幕阅读器："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:147
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% yasr\n"
msgstr "% yasr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:151
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The global configuration file for yasr is located at [.filename]#/usr/local/"
"share/yasr/yasr.conf#.  To create a user-specific configuration file, copy "
"the global one to your home directory:"
msgstr "yasr 的全局配置文件位于 [.filename]#/usr/local/share/yasr/yasr.conf#。若要创建用户专用的配置文件，请将全局配置文件复制到主目录："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:155
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% cp /usr/local/share/yasr/yasr.conf ~/.yasr.conf\n"
msgstr "% cp /usr/local/share/yasr/yasr.conf ~/.yasr.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:158
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For details on configuration options and keyboard shortcuts, refer to man:"
"yasr[1]."
msgstr "有关配置选项和键盘快捷键的详细信息，请参阅 man:yasr[1]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:160
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Speech Synthesizer"
msgstr "语音合成器"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:164
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The purpose of the speech synthesizer is to provide audio output for screen "
"readers by converting on-screen text to speech.  This section explains how "
"to install speech synthesizers, perform a basic functionality test, and "
"locate their documentation for further configuration."
msgstr "语音合成器的作用是将屏幕上的文本转换为语音，为屏幕阅读器提供音频输出。本节介绍如何安装语音合成器、执行基本功能测试，以及在哪里查找进一步配置所需的文档。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Information about the FreeBSD audio subsystem can be found in extref:"
"{handbook}multimedia[Multimedia] and in the man:sound[4] manual page."
msgstr "有关 FreeBSD 音频子系统的信息，请参阅 extref:{handbook}multimedia[多媒体]和 man:sound[4] 手册页。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:171
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "eSpeak NG"
msgstr "eSpeak NG"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:174
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:audio/espeak-ng[] package provides man:espeak-ng[1], a "
"multilingual speech synthesizer."
msgstr "package:audio/espeak-ng[] 软件包提供 man:espeak-ng[1]，这是一款多语言语音合成器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:176
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install, run:"
msgstr "运行以下命令进行安装："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:180
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install espeak-ng\n"
msgstr "# pkg install espeak-ng\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:183
#, fuzzy
msgid "To test, execute the following command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令进行测试："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:187
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% espeak-ng \"Hello World, FreeBSD!\"\n"
msgstr "% espeak-ng \"Hello World, FreeBSD!\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:191
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"eSpeak NG is a versatile and feature-rich utility.  For more information, "
"consult its manual page, man:espeak-ng[1], and the https://github.com/espeak-"
"ng/espeak-ng/blob/master/docs/index.md[official online documentation]."
msgstr "eSpeak NG 是一款用途广泛、功能丰富的工具。更多信息请参阅其手册页 man:espeak-ng[1]以及 link:https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng/blob/master/docs/index.md[官方在线文档]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:193
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Flite"
msgstr "Flite"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"package:audio/flite[] is a speech synthesizer that is part of the http://"
"festvox.org[FestVox] project.  It is designed as a small and fast "
"alternative to crossref:blindness[festival, Festival], built using the "
"FestVox suite.  To install, run:"
msgstr "package:audio/flite[] 是 FestVox 项目的一部分，是一款语音合成器。它使用 FestVox 套件构建，旨在成为 crossref:blindness[festival,Festival] 的小巧快速替代方案。运行以下命令进行安装："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:202
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install flite\n"
msgstr "# pkg install flite\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:205
#, fuzzy
msgid "To test, execute the following commands:"
msgstr "执行以下命令进行测试："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:211
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% flite \"Hello world, BSD!\"\n"
"% flite_time 10:30\n"
"The time is now, exactly half past ten, in the morning.\n"
msgstr "% flite \"Hello world, BSD!\"\n% flite_time 10:30\nThe time is now, exactly half past ten, in the morning.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:215
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The project does not provide a manual page.  Documentation is available in [."
"filename]#/usr/local/share/doc/flite/README.md# and http://www.festvox.org/"
"flite/doc/index.html[online]."
msgstr "该项目不提供手册页。文档可在 [.filename]#/usr/local/share/doc/flite/README.md# 和 link:http://www.festvox.org/flite/doc/index.html[在线]查阅。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:217
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Festival"
msgstr "Festival"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:221
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:audio/festival[] package provides man:festival[1], a "
"multilingual speech synthesizer.  To install, run:"
msgstr "package:audio/festival[] 软件包提供 man:festival[1]，这是一款多语言语音合成器。运行以下命令进行安装："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:225
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install festival\n"
msgstr "# pkg install festival\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:229
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Festival needs at least one festvox-_voice_ package to generate a synthetic "
"voice.  Run the following command to list available voice packages:"
