#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:269
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For more information about Festival, consult its manual page, man:"
"festival[1], and the http://www.festvox.org/docs/manual-2.4.0/festival_toc."
"html[official online documentation]."
msgstr "有关 Festival 的更多信息，请参阅其手册页 man:festival[1]以及 link:http://www.festvox.org/docs/manual-2.4.0/festival_toc.html[官方在线文档]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:271
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Speech Dispatcher"
msgstr "Speech Dispatcher"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:275
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Speech Dispatcher project provides a high-level device independent layer "
"for access to speech synthesis.  To install package:accessibility/speech-"
"dispatcher[], run:"
msgstr "Speech Dispatcher 项目提供了一个高层、与设备无关的语音合成访问层。运行以下命令安装 package:accessibility/speech-dispatcher[]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:279
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install speech-dispatcher\n"
msgstr "# pkg install speech-dispatcher\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:286
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% spd-say \"Hello world, FreeBSD!\"\n"
msgstr "% spd-say \"Hello world, FreeBSD!\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:289
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Speech Dispatcher provides two manual pages, man:spd-say[1] and man:speech-"
"dispatcher[1], as well as https://freebsoft.org/speechd[online "
"documentation]."
msgstr "Speech Dispatcher 提供两个手册页：man:spd-say[1] 和 man:speech-dispatcher[1]，并提供 link:https://freebsoft.org/speechd[在线文档]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:294
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:audio/festival-freebsoft-utils[] package provides additional "
