#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:297
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Ports Collection"
msgstr "Ports 集合"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:302
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD provides the extref:{handbook}ports[Ports Collection], which offers "
"a simple way to install applications.  Some ports allow you to configure "
"options before building and installation.  By default, configuration is "
"handled through a TUI menu not accessible by a screen reader."
msgstr "FreeBSD 提供了 extref:{handbook}ports[Ports 集合]，可用于轻松安装应用程序。某些 Port 允许在构建和安装之前配置选项。默认情况下，配置通过屏幕阅读器无法访问的 TUI 菜单进行。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:305
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:ports-mgmt/portoptscli[] utility is a text-only tool "
"specifically designed to configure ports using a screen reader.  To install "
"it, run:"
msgstr "package:ports-mgmt/portoptscli[] 是一款纯文本工具，专为使用屏幕阅读器配置 Port 而设计。运行以下命令进行安装："

