"man:ed[1], but with extended functionality."
msgstr "Edbrowse 是一款基于文本的浏览器、编辑器、IRC 聊天客户端和邮件客户端，专为屏幕阅读器用户设计。其界面类似于 man:ed[1]，但功能更丰富。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:359
#, fuzzy
