msgstr "% echo \"FreeBSD Accessibility Handbook\" | lou_translate -f unicode.dis,en-us-g2.ctb\n⠠⠋⠗⠑⠑⠠⠠⠃⠎⠙⠀⠠⠁⠒⠑⠎⠎⠊⠃⠊⠇⠰⠽⠀⠠⠓⠯⠃⠕⠕⠅\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/blindness/_index.adoc:466
#, fuzzy
